{"version":2,"slug":"spend-a-day-at-the-beach-with-me-learn-english-naturally","videoId":"aSGMUmmT-nY","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/aSGMUmmT-nY","lang":"en","title":"Spend a Day at the Beach With Me | Learn English Naturally","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Today,"},{"start":1,"text":"you're not going to study English with"},{"start":5,"text":"me. You're going to spend the day"},{"start":8,"text":"[music]"},{"start":8.6,"text":"at the beach with me."},{"start":11,"text":"Completely"},{"start":13,"text":"in English. I'm going to take you with"},{"start":16,"text":"me"},{"start":17,"text":"while"},{"start":18,"text":"[music]"},{"start":18.6,"text":"I pack"},{"start":20,"text":"my things."},{"start":23,"text":"While I walk around,"},{"start":26,"text":"[music]"},{"start":26.6,"text":"while I go to the beach,"},{"start":29,"text":"and hopefully while we watch the sun"},{"start":35,"text":"set. And the entire [music] time"},{"start":39,"text":"we're going to be speaking"},{"start":42,"text":"English."},{"start":44,"text":"My beach [music] bag because of"},{"start":46,"text":"something else looks really calm. We"},{"start":50,"text":"should have. I'm going to get in"},{"start":53,"text":"the water. Don't worry about"},{"start":56,"text":"understanding [music] every single word."},{"start":60,"text":"And try to understand me"},{"start":63,"text":"through context. Okay?"},{"start":67,"text":"Let's get ready. [music] We're in La"},{"start":69,"text":"Paz, by the way."},{"start":71,"text":"It's in Baja California Sur, in the"},{"start":74,"text":"north"},{"start":75,"text":"of Mexico."},{"start":77,"text":"Okay."},{"start":78,"text":"First, let me show you what I have in"},{"start":83,"text":"my bag."},{"start":86,"text":"My beach bag."},{"start":88,"text":"It's not really a beach bag."},{"start":91,"text":"It's more of just"},{"start":94,"text":"a normal backpack,"},{"start":97,"text":"but it's my beach bag for today."},{"start":100,"text":"So, let's see what I have inside. But"},{"start":102,"text":"first,"},{"start":104,"text":"what do you pack"},{"start":106,"text":"for the beach?"},{"start":108,"text":"What do you put inside your"},{"start":113,"text":"beach bag? So, let's see what I have."},{"start":115,"text":"So, first of all, I have"},{"start":117,"text":"my camera, the one I'm recording with"},{"start":120,"text":"right now,"},{"start":121,"text":"cuz I was recording for today."},{"start":124,"text":"Then, I have"},{"start":127,"text":"some sunglasses."},{"start":131,"text":"These are new sunglasses,"},{"start":133,"text":"my new favorite sunglasses,"},{"start":137,"text":"because they're pink."},{"start":141,"text":"And you guys know I've been loving the"},{"start":143,"text":"color pink"},{"start":144,"text":"lately."},{"start":146,"text":"Do you like these?"},{"start":147,"text":"Tell me in the comments."},{"start":150,"text":"Then, we have"},{"start":152,"text":"my microphone."},{"start":155,"text":"This is the microphone"},{"start":158,"text":"I use"},{"start":159,"text":"to record my videos."},{"start":162,"text":"It's really good."},{"start":164,"text":"I have"},{"start":166,"text":"a towel,"},{"start":169,"text":"a beach towel."},{"start":171,"text":"Next, we have Oops."},{"start":173,"text":"my shirt."},{"start":175,"text":"Let me show you guys."},{"start":177,"text":"A shirt I brought um just kind of to"},{"start":180,"text":"wear"},{"start":181,"text":"after I swim,"},{"start":184,"text":"because it's a little bit uncomfortable"},{"start":187,"text":"to wear a shirt like this"},{"start":189,"text":"um after swimming, cuz it's so tight."},{"start":192,"text":"A loose"},{"start":194,"text":"loose shirts are really nice for after"},{"start":197,"text":"swimming, especially when you're all"},{"start":199,"text":"sticky from the salt water in the ocean."},{"start":203,"text":"Then, what else? Oh,"},{"start":206,"text":"then we have"},{"start":207,"text":"in the front pockets. So, these are the"},{"start":210,"text":"front pockets."},{"start":211,"text":"My wallet"},{"start":214,"text":"and my headphones."},{"start":217,"text":"I have"},{"start":219,"text":"a hat"},{"start":221,"text":"to protect my skin"},{"start":224,"text":"from"},{"start":225,"text":"the sun rays."},{"start":228,"text":"And I have sunscreen on my face."},{"start":231,"text":"So, I didn't bring my sunscreen with me."},{"start":235,"text":"Even though I probably should have."},{"start":239,"text":"Next time I will bring my sunscreen."},{"start":244,"text":"I'll learn"},{"start":245,"text":"from my mistake."},{"start":248,"text":"So, remember, should have we use when"},{"start":253,"text":"we didn't do something, but we think"},{"start":257,"text":"that we should have."},{"start":259,"text":"We think that next time"},{"start":262,"text":"we will."},{"start":264,"text":"We should have."},{"start":266,"text":"We use it when we didn't do something."},{"start":269,"text":"We didn't do it. Now, would have is a"},{"start":272,"text":"little different."},{"start":273,"text":"If I say, I would have brought my"},{"start":276,"text":"sunscreen,"},{"start":278,"text":"but"},{"start":279,"text":"I didn't because I already put it on."},{"start":283,"text":"Would have means I intentionally did it"},{"start":287,"text":"because of something else."},{"start":290,"text":"I would have brought my sunscreen, but I"},{"start":293,"text":"didn't"},{"start":294,"text":"because I didn't need it."},{"start":297,"text":"It wasn't necessary."},{"start":298,"text":"I would have if I needed to, but I"},{"start":301,"text":"didn't. If I hadn't put on sunscreen,"},{"start":306,"text":"and I forgot to pack sunscreen,"},{"start":311,"text":"then I would have gotten"},{"start":315,"text":"sunburned."},{"start":316,"text":"If your skin turns red"},{"start":321,"text":"after being in the sun for a long time,"},{"start":325,"text":"then"},{"start":326,"text":"that's called"},{"start":328,"text":"sunburn."},{"start":330,"text":"That's getting sunburned."},{"start":333,"text":"Have you ever gotten sunburned?"},{"start":338,"text":"Maybe on your shoulders, your chest,"},{"start":341,"text":"maybe your forehead got sunburned."},{"start":345,"text":"Tell me in the comments. I have my"},{"start":348,"text":"swimsuit on"},{"start":351,"text":"underneath"},{"start":352,"text":"so that I can just take off my shirt"},{"start":356,"text":"and get in the ocean."},{"start":359,"text":"I also am wearing flip-flops."},{"start":363,"text":"So, these are called sandals or"},{"start":367,"text":"flip-flops."},{"start":368,"text":"And normally you wear these at the"},{"start":371,"text":"beach, flip-flops."},{"start":374,"text":"Okay. I'll put on my sunglasses,"},{"start":377,"text":"put on my hat,"},{"start":380,"text":"and let's go head to the beach."},{"start":388,"text":"Now we're walking"},{"start":390,"text":"to"},{"start":392,"text":"the beach."},{"start":394,"text":"So, let me show you guys"},{"start":396,"text":"the view. So, just then I was at the"},{"start":399,"text":"kiosk."},{"start":401,"text":"So, that's the kiosk over there."},{"start":404,"text":"And"},{"start":406,"text":"here is the pier."},{"start":409,"text":"Now we're walking to"},{"start":411,"text":"the beach."},{"start":413,"text":"So, I want to sit on the sand."},{"start":417,"text":"And while we're on the sand,"},{"start":419,"text":"I'll tell you guys a little more Wait."},{"start":422,"text":"About this beach that I'm on."},{"start":426,"text":"Now look at that."},{"start":428,"text":"We made it."},{"start":429,"text":"There aren't very many people here"},{"start":432,"text":"today."},{"start":433,"text":"The beach is very empty."},{"start":435,"text":"The water"},{"start":437,"text":"looks really calm."},{"start":439,"text":"Like the waves, they're super calm. The"},{"start":442,"text":"sky is a little bit cloudy."},{"start":446,"text":"It's not super clear at the moment, but"},{"start":450,"text":"it still"},{"start":451,"text":"keeps it fresh. It's not"},{"start":455,"text":"too insanely hot. Now, it's not just"},{"start":458,"text":"warm."},{"start":459,"text":"I would say it's hot."},{"start":462,"text":"So, to be hot"},{"start":464,"text":"is almost to be scorching."},{"start":467,"text":"So, if I say it's scorching hot, that"},{"start":471,"text":"means it's really hot."},{"start":474,"text":"Not just warm. And right now,"},{"start":477,"text":"it's not scorching hot because the sun"},{"start":481,"text":"isn't super intense."},{"start":484,"text":"But,"},{"start":485,"text":"it is hot. Don't get me wrong. It's very"},{"start":488,"text":"hot. So, actually, before I describe"},{"start":492,"text":"everything to you,"},{"start":494,"text":"before I tell you what this is, what"},{"start":496,"text":"that is,"},{"start":498,"text":"I want you to tell me what you see."},{"start":502,"text":"So, what can you see?"},{"start":505,"text":"You don't need to know"},{"start":508,"text":"tons of English vocabulary to tell me or"},{"start":512,"text":"any complicated words."},{"start":515,"text":"You could say the water is blue, the"},{"start":519,"text":"beach is quiet, or that the sun is"},{"start":523,"text":"shining."},{"start":525,"text":"Maybe that there are people swimming."},{"start":529,"text":"Simple English is still English. Okay."},{"start":534,"text":"Here's how I would describe it."},{"start":537,"text":"The water is calm."},{"start":541,"text":"The waves"},{"start":542,"text":"are small."},{"start":545,"text":"The sky"},{"start":546,"text":"is cloudy."},{"start":549,"text":"And the sand"},{"start":552,"text":"feels"},{"start":554,"text":"rough."},{"start":556,"text":"There's a nice breeze"},{"start":559,"text":"coming from the ocean."},{"start":561,"text":"Now, something I really want you to"},{"start":563,"text":"practice in English"},{"start":566,"text":"is describing your surroundings."},{"start":569,"text":"You can do this anywhere. When you're"},{"start":572,"text":"walking,"},{"start":573,"text":"the street is busy."},{"start":576,"text":"When you're having a coffee,"},{"start":579,"text":"this brew"},{"start":581,"text":"is hot."},{"start":582,"text":"When you're at home,"},{"start":584,"text":"I need to clean my kitchen. And you"},{"start":587,"text":"don't need an English-speaking person"},{"start":590,"text":"next to you to start using it. Okay."},{"start":594,"text":"Now, I think I'm going to get in"},{"start":598,"text":"the water."},{"start":599,"text":"Notice how I didn't say"},{"start":602,"text":"I'm going to enter the ocean."},{"start":605,"text":"I just said, \"I'm going to get in now.\""},{"start":608,"text":"Okay."},{"start":610,"text":"We've been practicing a lot of English."},{"start":613,"text":"But now, I just want to talk to you."},{"start":617,"text":"Because this is something I want you to"},{"start":620,"text":"start doing more"},{"start":623,"text":"when you're practicing English. Stop"},{"start":625,"text":"treating English like a school subject"},{"start":629,"text":"that you study for and memorize. English"},{"start":633,"text":"isn't just grammar."},{"start":635,"text":"It isn't a test. It isn't something you"},{"start":640,"text":"need to finish learning"},{"start":642,"text":"before starting to use it. It's a"},{"start":646,"text":"language."},{"start":647,"text":"It's something you can experience"},{"start":650,"text":"life"},{"start":651,"text":"through."},{"start":652,"text":"I think about what we did today."},{"start":656,"text":"We walked."},{"start":658,"text":"We went swimming."},{"start":660,"text":"We looked at the ocean."},{"start":663,"text":"We talked."},{"start":665,"text":"And you experienced"},{"start":667,"text":"all of that"},{"start":669,"text":"in English. And maybe there were words"},{"start":672,"text":"that you didn't understand completely."},{"start":676,"text":"But that's okay."},{"start":678,"text":"You don't need to understand every word"},{"start":682,"text":"to have a conversation,"},{"start":684,"text":"a meaningful conversation. I think"},{"start":688,"text":"sometimes English learners wait for the"},{"start":691,"text":"moment when they're ready"},{"start":695,"text":"to speak. When my grammar gets better,"},{"start":699,"text":"then I'll be ready. When I know more"},{"start":702,"text":"vocabulary."},{"start":704,"text":"When my pronunciation improves,"},{"start":707,"text":"then I'll speak."},{"start":709,"text":"But speaking is part of how those things"},{"start":714,"text":"improve, not when. You don't become"},{"start":717,"text":"confident and then start speaking."},{"start":721,"text":"You become confident because you started"},{"start":724,"text":"speaking. And that's exactly what we do"},{"start":728,"text":"in my English community. The Slow"},{"start":731,"text":"English community."},{"start":734,"text":"And we're opening in"},{"start":736,"text":"October. At the beginning of October."},{"start":739,"text":"So, be sure to join the waitlist to"},{"start":741,"text":"start speaking English with other"},{"start":743,"text":"English learners from around the world."},{"start":746,"text":"No judgment, no pressure to speak. Now,"},{"start":749,"text":"imagine"},{"start":751,"text":"what you would do"},{"start":753,"text":"if you weren't afraid of making"},{"start":756,"text":"mistakes. Would you travel? Would you"},{"start":759,"text":"make new friends?"},{"start":761,"text":"Would you apply for a new job? Think"},{"start":764,"text":"about your answer."},{"start":765,"text":"Now, you have to talk."},{"start":768,"text":"I'm going to ask you five questions"},{"start":771,"text":"and you have to answer out loud. Not in"},{"start":775,"text":"your head."},{"start":776,"text":"Okay?"},{"start":777,"text":"Ready? What is the weather like where"},{"start":781,"text":"you are right now?"},{"start":784,"text":"Pause."},{"start":785,"text":"Number [clears throat] two."},{"start":787,"text":"Do you prefer the beach"},{"start":791,"text":"or the mountains?"},{"start":793,"text":"Pause. Number three."},{"start":796,"text":"What's something you always bring"},{"start":800,"text":"to the beach?"},{"start":802,"text":"Pause."},{"start":803,"text":"Number four."},{"start":805,"text":"When was the last time you went"},{"start":808,"text":"swimming?"},{"start":810,"text":"Pause."},{"start":812,"text":"And number five."},{"start":814,"text":"If you could travel to anywhere in the"},{"start":817,"text":"world right now,"},{"start":820,"text":"where would you go?"},{"start":823,"text":"Pause."},{"start":824,"text":"Oh, and why? Tell me. Pause. And if"},{"start":827,"text":"answering those questions felt"},{"start":830,"text":"difficult,"},{"start":831,"text":"that means that you actually practiced."},{"start":835,"text":"Congratulations."},{"start":836,"text":"I'm proud of you. I'm proud that you're"},{"start":839,"text":"not giving up on your dreams."},{"start":842,"text":"Whether that's English or whether that's"},{"start":844,"text":"learning English for something else,"},{"start":846,"text":"you're still pursuing your dreams."},{"start":849,"text":"You're not letting them be forgotten."},{"start":852,"text":"Now, before we leave, let's do one last"},{"start":855,"text":"thing."},{"start":856,"text":"I'm going to say a sentence,"},{"start":859,"text":"and you'll listen, then"},{"start":863,"text":"repeat. Ready? I spent the day at the"},{"start":868,"text":"beach."},{"start":873,"text":"The water was crystal clear."},{"start":883,"text":"I walked barefoot"},{"start":886,"text":"along the shore."},{"start":893,"text":"The sand was scorching"},{"start":897,"text":"hot."},{"start":903,"text":"I watched the sunset"},{"start":906,"text":"over the ocean."},{"start":913,"text":"I don't need perfect English to start"},{"start":918,"text":"speaking."},{"start":924,"text":"Hehehe."},{"start":925,"text":"A little faster."},{"start":927,"text":"I don't need perfect English to start"},{"start":929,"text":"speaking."},{"start":932,"text":"[snorts]"},{"start":932.6,"text":"You don't."},{"start":934,"text":"How much of this video did you"},{"start":936,"text":"understand? And also tell me"},{"start":939,"text":"where should we spend our next day"},{"start":943,"text":"together?"},{"start":944,"text":"Maybe at the coffee shop, maybe at a"},{"start":947,"text":"restaurant. I think we should make this"},{"start":950,"text":"a series. What do you think?"},{"start":953,"text":"If you enjoyed this video, I'm sure"},{"start":955,"text":"you'll enjoy the next one I have for you"},{"start":958,"text":"here."},{"start":959,"text":"I'll see you guys next time."},{"start":962,"text":"Remember, never stop learning."},{"start":966,"text":"Bye."}]}